}
```
Reason:
The fix involves explicitly clearing the RA bit when promiscuous mode is not active. The first statement is retained to ensure that the RA bit is cleared, and the second statement is added to ensure that the RA bit is explicitly cleared when the device is not in promiscuous mode, preventing it from receiving all packets unintentionally. This ensures the expected behavior of the network device when toggling promiscuous mode.

